{"id":"d2875fa6e7542298","group":"58","path":"58/batch03/58-df-zfc-largecard4-rank-into-rank-embedding.md","title":"ZFC Largecard4 Rank Into Rank Embedding","display":"df-zfc-largecard4-rank-into-rank-embedding — ZFC Largecard4 Rank Into Rank Embedding","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-largecard4-rank-into-rank-embedding","aliases":["58-df-zfc-largecard4-rank-into-rank-embedding"],"display":"df-zfc-largecard4-rank-into-rank-embedding — ZFC Largecard4 Rank Into Rank Embedding","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch06/58-df-first-order-language.md]]","[[58-df-critical-point]]","[[58-df-elementary-embedding]]","[[58-df-hierarchy]]","[[58-df-limit-ordinal]]","[[58-df-ordinal]]","[[58-df-structure]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-largecard4-rank-into-rank-embedding"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-largecard4-rank-into-rank-embedding</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-largecard4-rank-into-rank-embedding — ZFC Largecard4 Rank Into Rank Embedding"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3888033a846b1cd5\" href=\"?note=3888033a846b1cd5\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-first-order-language.md\">../batch06/58-df-first-order-language.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"327fc5339902933e\" href=\"?note=327fc5339902933e\" title=\"58-df-critical-point\">58-df-critical-point</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a25c0a66cf56c0f4\" href=\"?note=a25c0a66cf56c0f4\" title=\"58-df-elementary-embedding\">58-df-elementary-embedding</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"19e9a8c33d5c841c\" href=\"?note=19e9a8c33d5c841c\" title=\"58-df-hierarchy\">58-df-hierarchy</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"30f7fa6c101bbb39\" href=\"?note=30f7fa6c101bbb39\" title=\"58-df-limit-ordinal\">58-df-limit-ordinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"58-df-ordinal\">58-df-ordinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"58-df-structure\">58-df-structure</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda,j,\\kappa,\\mathcal V_\\lambda\\in V\">\\(\\lambda,j,\\kappa,\\mathcal V_\\lambda\\in V\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V_\\lambda\\in V\">\\(V_\\lambda\\in V\\)</span> is the hierarchy level from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"19e9a8c33d5c841c\" href=\"?note=19e9a8c33d5c841c\" title=\"58-df-hierarchy\">58-df-hierarchy</a></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal}:V\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal}:V\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"58-df-ordinal\">58-df-ordinal</a>), <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Limit}:V\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\">\\(\\mathrm{Limit}:V\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"30f7fa6c101bbb39\" href=\"?note=30f7fa6c101bbb39\" title=\"58-df-limit-ordinal\">58-df-limit-ordinal</a>), and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbedding}_S:V^3\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\">\\(\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbedding}_S:V^3\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"a25c0a66cf56c0f4\" href=\"?note=a25c0a66cf56c0f4\" title=\"58-df-elementary-embedding\">58-df-elementary-embedding</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Struct}_S:V^2\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\">\\(\\mathrm{Struct}_S:V^2\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Univ}:V\\to V\">\\(\\mathrm{Univ}:V\\to V\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CriticalPoint}_S:V^4\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\">\\(\\mathrm{CriticalPoint}_S:V^4\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I^{\\mathcal V_\\lambda}_{\\mathrm{rel},2}\">\\(I^{\\mathcal V_\\lambda}_{\\mathrm{rel},2}\\)</span> is the binary relation-interpretation projection of the set-coded structure</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_\\in\">\\(\\mathcal L_\\in\\)</span> is the canonical membership language with binary relation symbol <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\dot\\in\">\\(\\dot\\in\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcLargecard4RankIntoRankEmbedding}_S:V^2\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcLargecard4RankIntoRankEmbedding}_S:V^2\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_\\in=\\langle\\{\\dot\\in\\},\\varnothing,\\varnothing,\\{\\langle\\dot\\in,2\\rangle\\}\\rangle\">\\(\\mathcal L_\\in=\\langle\\{\\dot\\in\\},\\varnothing,\\varnothing,\\{\\langle\\dot\\in,2\\rangle\\}\\rangle\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_{\\in}=\\mathcal L_\\in\">\\(\\mathcal L_{\\in}=\\mathcal L_\\in\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZFC}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZFC}\\)</span>（若出现）取书内公理文件中的句子码集。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}largecard4\\text{-}rank\\text{-}into\\text{-}rank\\text{-}embedding}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcLargecard4RankIntoRankEmbedding}_S(\\lambda,j)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\lambda)\\land\\mathrm{Limit}(\\lambda)\n\\land\\exists\\mathcal V_\\lambda,\\kappa\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal V_\\lambda,\\mathcal L_\\in)\n\\land\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal V_\\lambda)=V_\\lambda\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{7em}\\land I^{\\mathcal V_\\lambda}_{\\mathrm{rel},2}(\\dot\\in)\n=\\{a\\in V_\\lambda^2:a(0)\\in a(1)\\}\n\\land\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbedding}_S(j,\\mathcal V_\\lambda,\\mathcal V_\\lambda)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{7em}\\land\\kappa\\in\\lambda\n\\land\\mathrm{CriticalPoint}_S(\\kappa,j,\\mathcal V_\\lambda,\\mathcal V_\\lambda)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}largecard4\\text{-}rank\\text{-}into\\text{-}rank\\text{-}embedding}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcLargecard4RankIntoRankEmbedding}_S(\\lambda,j)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\lambda)\\land\\mathrm{Limit}(\\lambda)\n\\land\\exists\\mathcal V_\\lambda,\\kappa\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal V_\\lambda,\\mathcal L_\\in)\n\\land\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal V_\\lambda)=V_\\lambda\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{7em}\\land I^{\\mathcal V_\\lambda}_{\\mathrm{rel},2}(\\dot\\in)\n=\\{a\\in V_\\lambda^2:a(0)\\in a(1)\\}\n\\land\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbedding}_S(j,\\mathcal V_\\lambda,\\mathcal V_\\lambda)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{7em}\\land\\kappa\\in\\lambda\n\\land\\mathrm{CriticalPoint}_S(\\kappa,j,\\mathcal V_\\lambda,\\mathcal V_\\lambda)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Elementarity is applied to the set-coded membership structure on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V_\\lambda\">\\(V_\\lambda\\)</span>, rather than to a bare set with an unbound satisfaction relation.</li>\n<li>Nontriviality is witnessed by the sourced four-place critical-point predicate; no partial global <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{crit}(j)\">\\(\\operatorname{crit}(j)\\)</span> operator is used.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch06/58-df-first-order-language.md","status":"resolved","id":"3888033a846b1cd5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-first-order-language.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-critical-point","status":"resolved","id":"327fc5339902933e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-critical-point]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-elementary-embedding","status":"resolved","id":"a25c0a66cf56c0f4","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-elementary-embedding]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-hierarchy","status":"resolved","id":"19e9a8c33d5c841c","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-hierarchy]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-limit-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"30f7fa6c101bbb39","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-limit-ordinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-ordinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"d9b8711cda3f31ca","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-s